WEBVTT

01:50.320 --> 01:51.960
The doctor said
it's a minor bone fracture.

01:52.840 --> 01:56.120
Avoid intense physical activity,
and you'll recover soon.

01:56.200 --> 01:58.400
Rest well in the next few days.

01:58.480 --> 01:59.960
Eat some nutritious food.

02:00.480 --> 02:03.360
Have you finished? Please leave.

02:09.400 --> 02:11.920
Rest well. I'll visit you tomorrow.

02:13.920 --> 02:14.760
Tang Qi.

02:16.840 --> 02:17.840
What?

02:20.480 --> 02:22.160
Why don't you understand?

02:22.880 --> 02:24.720
I don't want to see you.

02:24.800 --> 02:26.680
I jumped into the lake and faked illness

02:26.760 --> 02:29.200
because I hate you
and don't want to see you.

02:29.280 --> 02:31.960
However, you didn't give up
but went to Lin Yuan's place

02:32.040 --> 02:33.480
and got me injured.

02:35.160 --> 02:36.400
Tang Qi,

02:36.480 --> 02:38.600
I've made it clear enough.

02:39.360 --> 02:40.280
Please leave.

02:48.280 --> 02:49.320
Sorry.

02:49.920 --> 02:52.480
You got injured because of me.

03:06.200 --> 03:07.040
What's wrong with him?

03:08.080 --> 03:09.640
I rejected him directly.

03:11.600 --> 03:15.480
That's great comic material!
I can't believe I missed it!

03:15.560 --> 03:17.920
X-RAY FILM

03:22.840 --> 03:25.480
I only fell off by accident.
Why do I have to be hospitalized?

03:25.560 --> 03:27.680
Compared to your appearance and shape,

03:27.760 --> 03:29.520
something's wrong with your physical exam.

03:29.600 --> 03:31.240
You should stay here.

03:31.320 --> 03:34.440
If they confirm you're healthy,
you can leave the hospital.

03:35.080 --> 03:37.360
But I need to talk
with my editor tomorrow morning

03:37.440 --> 03:38.960
about my new comics.

03:39.480 --> 03:40.400
I'll pick you up later.

03:41.440 --> 03:43.200
No problem.

03:49.600 --> 03:51.560
- Good morning, Yi.
- Good morning.

03:51.640 --> 03:52.640
Good morning.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.600
SU CHENGCHENG

04:13.960 --> 04:15.080
What's the matter?

04:15.800 --> 04:18.760
Have you finished reading the proposal
I sent you yesterday?

04:18.839 --> 04:21.360
If you have any questions, you can ask me.

04:21.440 --> 04:22.480
No.

04:25.720 --> 04:26.560
The meeting is about to start.

04:26.640 --> 04:28.440
I need to prepare for it.

04:29.120 --> 04:31.520
Okay, thank you.

04:35.840 --> 04:39.960
Good eyeshadow
needs to balance coloring and fallout.

04:40.040 --> 04:42.640
Starlight Eyeshadow's strength
is coloring.

04:42.720 --> 04:44.840
The power is smooth
and has rich layers of color.

04:45.480 --> 04:47.800
We've optimized its effect,

04:47.880 --> 04:49.760
not only avoiding fallout,

04:49.840 --> 04:52.800
but also improving
its durability and ductility.

04:53.400 --> 04:54.600
Even if it's smudged by liquids

04:54.680 --> 04:57.160
containing ethanol,
such as drinks or beer,

04:57.760 --> 04:59.480
Starlight Eyeshadow
can last for over ten hours

04:59.560 --> 05:01.240
without falling out.

05:10.120 --> 05:12.000
Did you make this plan?

05:13.160 --> 05:14.480
Yes.

05:14.560 --> 05:17.160
Where did you get the data
for the products?

05:18.800 --> 05:21.360
Only Mr. Tang has such detailed data.

05:21.440 --> 05:22.920
Sorry, I can't help you.

05:25.000 --> 05:26.160
I teamed up with Su Chengcheng,

05:26.240 --> 05:28.400
but she got sick and couldn't help much,

05:28.480 --> 05:30.680
so I asked her
to collect data and information.

05:31.640 --> 05:33.880
Mr. Tang, is there anything wrong
with the data?

05:35.840 --> 05:37.000
No.

05:37.080 --> 05:38.080
It's a great plan.

05:40.200 --> 05:42.680
You must've done thorough research
on the products.

05:43.840 --> 05:44.840
Thanks.

05:52.320 --> 05:54.960
That's all. I have to work. Bye.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.480
- Bill, please.
- Coming.

06:00.800 --> 06:02.960
Hello. It's 240 yuan in total.

06:10.560 --> 06:11.680
We have a new product.

06:11.760 --> 06:14.480
If you buy the drink,
you can get a lucky draw egg for free.

06:14.560 --> 06:17.480
The prize is a character doll
from Lost You Forever.

06:23.280 --> 06:24.800
That's great. I want ten cups.

06:26.040 --> 06:27.880
Oh, no. 20 cups.

06:28.560 --> 06:29.520
Here.

06:30.600 --> 06:31.600
Thanks.

06:33.120 --> 06:34.240
NEW PRODUCT, SMASH LUCKY EGGS

06:34.840 --> 06:37.560
The male lead is not handsome enough?

06:38.440 --> 06:40.400
His persona is so simple?

06:40.480 --> 06:41.840
Too few choices?

06:41.920 --> 06:44.520
Capture the market trends

06:45.360 --> 06:46.800
and the changes in audience preferences?

06:46.880 --> 06:49.400
You want me to draw
more male roles, don't you?

06:49.480 --> 06:52.000
Why don't you ask me to make the comic
version of Lost You Forever?

06:52.080 --> 06:53.880
I don't want couples, okay?

06:53.960 --> 06:56.040
I don't want relationships, okay?

07:10.200 --> 07:11.360
Hello, sir.

07:11.880 --> 07:13.080
I'd like a fruit bouquet.

07:14.160 --> 07:16.920
And this.

07:17.440 --> 07:20.560
Sir, you can get a lucky draw egg
for buying our new drink.

07:20.640 --> 07:24.120
The prize is a character doll
from Lost You Forever.

07:24.200 --> 07:25.240
Okay.

07:28.320 --> 07:31.240
Do you really have a prize?

07:32.280 --> 07:33.280
We do.

07:34.200 --> 07:35.160
Sir, here.

07:39.200 --> 07:40.600
CONGRATULATIONS

07:40.680 --> 07:41.880
Sir, congratulations.

07:41.960 --> 07:44.400
You've won a character doll
from Lost You Forever.

07:44.920 --> 07:45.760
Congratulations.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.520
How can I be that unlucky?

07:51.600 --> 07:52.920
Ten more drinks!

07:53.440 --> 07:55.480
Our new product is still on trial.

07:55.560 --> 07:56.880
It's limited.

07:56.960 --> 07:59.600
This customer just bought the last one.

08:00.640 --> 08:01.760
What a coincidence.

08:03.040 --> 08:05.880
If you like it, you can have it.

08:12.440 --> 08:13.680
I don't want charity.

08:16.200 --> 08:18.040
Miss, your drinks.

08:19.520 --> 08:20.720
Here you are.

08:32.520 --> 08:33.559
I haven't thanked you

08:33.640 --> 08:35.760
for giving my sister
an intern opportunity.

08:35.840 --> 08:37.760
Why are you giving me a gift?

08:38.720 --> 08:40.840
I want to ask you about some legal issues.

08:41.360 --> 08:43.960
This fruit bouquet is for Su Chengcheng.

08:45.640 --> 08:47.760
Chengcheng? Why?

08:48.680 --> 08:49.800
She's ill, isn't she?

08:50.400 --> 08:51.640
She's taken two days off.

08:51.720 --> 08:53.320
You don't know?

08:56.280 --> 08:57.480
I do.

08:57.560 --> 09:01.200
But I didn't expect you'd care
about your employees.

09:02.520 --> 09:05.960
I got this character doll
for free when I bought the bouquet.

09:06.040 --> 09:08.440
You can also give it to her.

09:10.080 --> 09:11.880
She's not interested,

09:12.400 --> 09:15.920
but her best friend draws comics
and loves collecting these dolls.

09:18.320 --> 09:19.200
Really?

09:21.640 --> 09:25.240
UPGRADING

09:25.320 --> 09:27.840
One night and one morning,

09:28.360 --> 09:30.000
and it's only 79%.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.880
Are you serious?

09:43.120 --> 09:46.840
IS THE MEETING OVER?

09:46.920 --> 09:49.680
Even if they didn't like my plan,

09:50.200 --> 09:51.920
you should've told me.

09:55.400 --> 09:56.960
UPGRADING

09:57.040 --> 09:58.600
Why is it so fast?

11:07.880 --> 11:09.160
Why are you here again?

11:11.680 --> 11:13.640
Your feet got injured. Don't move.

11:14.160 --> 11:15.400
What do you need?

11:16.120 --> 11:16.960
I can help.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.400
UPGRADING

11:39.400 --> 11:43.160
There's a dessert shop
outside the hospital,

11:43.840 --> 11:45.240
and the red bean paste is delicious.

11:45.320 --> 11:47.080
Can you buy it for me?

11:47.600 --> 11:48.960
Okay, I'll buy it now.

12:08.200 --> 12:09.920
DEAR CHENG

12:13.920 --> 12:15.040
Why didn't you answer my calls?

12:16.520 --> 12:17.640
Sales call.

12:18.160 --> 12:19.760
Why are you here?

12:20.480 --> 12:21.560
Where's Su Chengcheng?

12:22.440 --> 12:24.960
She's definitely at work.

12:28.240 --> 12:31.040
I'll ask you again.
You'd better think twice.

12:31.120 --> 12:33.720
Where's Su Chengcheng?

12:38.400 --> 12:40.640
Are you going to the hospital?
Come on. I'll join you.

12:42.560 --> 12:45.680
Qingli, I'll visit a friend's senior.

12:48.880 --> 12:51.880
Well, I guess Su Chengcheng
and I just got older.

12:52.960 --> 12:55.560
Should you call me Grandma or Aunt?

13:02.720 --> 13:07.040
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed
is not available at present.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.080
Please…

13:10.120 --> 13:11.640
Lin Yuan is so unreliable.

13:11.720 --> 13:13.360
UPGRADING

13:13.440 --> 13:17.040
You stall for time
when I need you to be faster,

13:17.120 --> 13:18.480
but you push me so hard

13:18.560 --> 13:20.800
when I want you to be slow.

14:26.000 --> 14:26.960
Wait.

14:35.760 --> 14:36.600
Su Miao?

14:40.840 --> 14:42.920
I'm not. Wrong person.

14:46.240 --> 14:47.280
The same bracelet

14:48.480 --> 14:50.160
and injury.

14:55.160 --> 14:58.160
I've told you I'm not. Wrong person!

14:59.880 --> 15:01.120
Qingli!

15:01.200 --> 15:02.720
Qingli! Listen to me!

15:04.280 --> 15:06.080
Qingli, listen to me.

15:07.200 --> 15:08.640
Don't run! What's going on?

15:09.440 --> 15:10.400
Hey!

16:14.920 --> 16:15.880
Su Chengcheng!

16:15.960 --> 16:18.840
Shouldn't you be in the ward?
Are you in a hurry?

16:18.920 --> 16:21.880
Sister, you're finally here.

16:26.680 --> 16:28.200
Now you remember me.

16:28.840 --> 16:29.680
Sorry.

16:32.120 --> 16:34.000
Let's finish the paperwork and leave.

16:34.600 --> 16:36.880
Yes, leave the hospital.
Chengcheng can't wait.

16:36.960 --> 16:37.840
Wait a minute.

16:51.680 --> 16:53.120
Su Chengcheng?

16:54.480 --> 16:55.600
Why are you in the hospital?

16:55.680 --> 16:59.120
Why… Why can't I be?

16:59.200 --> 17:00.520
Do you own this place?

17:02.600 --> 17:04.319
Su Miao came here, and so did you.

17:06.079 --> 17:08.079
I came here two days ago,

17:08.160 --> 17:09.960
and she came later.

17:10.040 --> 17:12.720
You should say I came here,

17:12.800 --> 17:14.079
and so did Su Miao.

17:16.280 --> 17:18.359
But your splint is fixed
in the same spot as Su Miao's.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.960
How's that possible?

17:21.920 --> 17:25.119
Yes, I was also wondering
why it was so coincidental.

17:27.839 --> 17:30.600
Best friends share happiness and pain.

17:39.440 --> 17:41.440
Have you finished? She's not a suspect.

17:41.520 --> 17:42.920
My sister got injured,

17:43.000 --> 17:45.160
and I brought her here.

17:45.240 --> 17:46.520
Is there a problem?

17:50.560 --> 17:51.640
No.

18:34.480 --> 18:36.160
Who's Su Miao?

18:37.120 --> 18:39.600
Why did Tang Qi ask you about her?

18:43.600 --> 18:45.680
Just a friend. Not close.

18:48.320 --> 18:50.800
Not close? Are you sure?

18:52.200 --> 18:55.600
Yes, I can testify. She's just a friend.

18:58.360 --> 19:01.280
You two are really stubborn.

19:01.360 --> 19:02.680
One last chance.

19:04.040 --> 19:04.920
What happened?

19:09.000 --> 19:11.280
Sister, nothing happened.

19:12.520 --> 19:13.560
Nothing.

19:23.880 --> 19:24.720
Still denying it?

19:26.160 --> 19:28.560
I'll ask Tang Qi about Su Miao right now.

19:29.120 --> 19:30.040
Sister!

19:30.120 --> 19:31.800
I'll tell you everything!

19:39.360 --> 19:41.200
Hello. Where's Ms. Su?

19:41.960 --> 19:44.280
She left. Don't you know?

19:44.360 --> 19:45.840
Left?

19:45.920 --> 19:46.840
Yes.

19:47.560 --> 19:48.600
By the way,

19:49.160 --> 19:50.960
she forgot her laptop.

19:51.040 --> 19:52.840
Please give it to her.

19:56.320 --> 19:57.960
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION

19:59.160 --> 20:00.360
Su Miao's laptop?

20:01.360 --> 20:03.320
I saw her use it before.

20:07.120 --> 20:09.720
Okay. I'll give it back.

20:15.120 --> 20:18.200
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed
is not available.

20:22.840 --> 20:23.960
Sorry…

20:44.560 --> 20:45.720
Filter?

20:48.880 --> 20:52.280
Do you mean you can swap faces?

20:56.200 --> 20:59.240
You can turn into a beauty
just like a fox monster?

21:03.640 --> 21:05.560
Why don't you show me?

21:06.360 --> 21:09.240
I don't want to scare you,
so I'm telling you first.

21:10.520 --> 21:12.880
Do you think I'm timid?

21:12.960 --> 21:16.120
Just do it. Impress me. Come on.

21:16.840 --> 21:17.760
Okay.

21:24.040 --> 21:26.800
FULL SCREEN, VOICE CHANGE
BEAUTY FILTER, OUTFIT, EFFECT

21:30.800 --> 21:33.680
Why is the interface different?

21:38.680 --> 21:40.760
There are new functions!

21:41.840 --> 21:45.480
I told you it would be more impressive
after reviving and upgrading.

21:45.560 --> 21:47.520
Let's check the new functions.

21:48.120 --> 21:49.520
Reviving?

21:49.600 --> 21:51.120
Can you stop acting?

21:51.200 --> 21:53.160
Do you want to ascend to heaven right now?

21:53.760 --> 21:55.880
- Sister, calm down.
- Su Chengcheng, you've got some guts.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.600
How dare you talk nonsense and lie to me?

22:07.080 --> 22:08.840
Well, do I look good?

22:09.440 --> 22:11.400
You…

22:11.480 --> 22:13.920
- Sister.
- Go away!

22:16.440 --> 22:17.760
Go away!

22:21.760 --> 22:23.360
The food delivery is here. I'll get it.

22:25.000 --> 22:26.960
Sister. Sister?

22:27.680 --> 22:30.360
Do I look good?

22:35.400 --> 22:36.640
Coming.

22:39.840 --> 22:41.240
I want to see Su Miao.

22:42.320 --> 22:44.400
- She's not here.
- Yes.

22:44.480 --> 22:47.480
I'm the beautiful girl who helped you

22:47.560 --> 22:49.240
chase away the bad guy.

22:49.320 --> 22:50.480
You said,

22:50.560 --> 22:54.840
"You're not only good-looking
but warm-hearted."

22:57.560 --> 22:59.480
I know she doesn't want to see me.

23:00.640 --> 23:02.640
Where's Su Chengcheng? I want to see her.

23:03.240 --> 23:05.480
Why would she come to my place?

23:05.560 --> 23:06.800
She's home.

23:06.880 --> 23:08.400
Where's Chengcheng?

23:08.480 --> 23:09.840
Chengcheng…

23:09.920 --> 23:11.400
Chengcheng is coming.

23:15.640 --> 23:17.040
Chengcheng is back!

23:20.840 --> 23:23.520
Well, do you believe me now?

23:28.240 --> 23:30.720
This is Su Chengcheng's work laptop.

23:31.560 --> 23:34.760
But the nurse found it in Su Miao's ward,

23:35.360 --> 23:36.680
and it was used,

23:37.240 --> 23:41.320
which means Su Miao might've stolen
our confidential documents.

23:41.400 --> 23:43.240
Su Chengcheng broke our rules.

23:43.320 --> 23:44.760
I need to talk to her.

23:45.760 --> 23:46.800
She didn't.

23:48.360 --> 23:49.560
Believe me.

23:49.640 --> 23:50.840
She didn't do it.

23:50.920 --> 23:54.360
No matter what,
she should face it herself.

24:02.480 --> 24:05.600
Tang Qi is here!
Chengcheng, Tang Qi is here!

24:14.720 --> 24:16.440
Where's Su Chengcheng?

24:18.680 --> 24:20.040
I brought the laptop.

24:22.840 --> 24:24.040
Don't ask me.

24:25.880 --> 24:27.480
I know nothing.

24:32.440 --> 24:34.480
Senior Tang, have a seat.

24:36.320 --> 24:37.680
Where's Chengcheng?

25:01.520 --> 25:03.400
YINTANG

25:07.760 --> 25:08.760
This bronze statue

25:10.440 --> 25:11.560
is so unique.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.360
Chengcheng…

25:17.680 --> 25:19.400
went to the bathroom upstairs.

25:21.040 --> 25:23.280
Senior Tang, I can show you around.

25:23.360 --> 25:26.120
You've been here a few times,
and I haven't treated you.

25:26.200 --> 25:27.960
It's so inappropriate.

25:29.640 --> 25:32.440
Chengcheng will be right back.
The layouts are quite unique.

25:32.520 --> 25:34.160
Check the kitchen.

25:34.760 --> 25:37.600
Look, here's the kitchenware.

25:37.680 --> 25:40.640
Look at this tree!
And the view outside the window!

25:40.720 --> 25:43.280
The view is so beautiful!

25:54.280 --> 25:55.400
This painting…

25:57.240 --> 25:58.680
I didn't see it

25:59.880 --> 26:01.520
when I came in.

26:07.040 --> 26:08.360
You did.

26:08.440 --> 26:10.480
You must've been too anxious to notice it.

26:11.040 --> 26:13.440
It's a graffiti from my friend.

26:13.520 --> 26:14.440
Nothing special.

26:14.520 --> 26:16.160
Let's check the kitchen.

26:16.240 --> 26:17.880
There are special layouts.

26:17.960 --> 26:19.920
Here's the kitchenware.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.720
Look at this tree!

26:22.520 --> 26:24.800
The view outside the window
is so beautiful,

26:35.480 --> 26:37.040
isn't it?

26:37.120 --> 26:38.280
Enough.

26:38.800 --> 26:41.200
I know the decoration is unique.

26:42.360 --> 26:43.880
But I'm not interested.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.160
Sorry.

26:54.680 --> 26:56.000
Okay, then. Have a seat.

26:57.440 --> 26:58.480
Have a seat.

27:08.120 --> 27:09.320
The bronze statue…

27:12.400 --> 27:14.120
And the painting…

27:16.640 --> 27:18.880
- I moved them away.
- You moved them?

27:22.760 --> 27:25.800
They don't fit the decoration.

27:25.880 --> 27:27.360
I didn't like them,

27:27.960 --> 27:31.880
so I moved them
when you were looking around.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.360
Exactly.

27:47.280 --> 27:48.160
Chengcheng is here.

27:59.920 --> 28:03.320
Your laptop was in Su Miao's ward.

28:15.880 --> 28:17.200
Sorry.

28:17.280 --> 28:19.000
Su Miao borrowed my laptop.

28:19.080 --> 28:23.160
I'm 100% sure
that she didn't do anything bad,

28:23.240 --> 28:25.480
but I was so careless and made a mistake.

28:25.560 --> 28:27.720
You can punish me.

28:29.560 --> 28:30.760
I trust Su Miao.

28:32.400 --> 28:35.040
She wouldn't check or steal our documents.

28:35.120 --> 28:36.640
This is over,

28:38.000 --> 28:38.840
but don't do it again.

28:39.480 --> 28:43.120
Please be more careful with your laptop.

28:43.840 --> 28:45.240
Don't lend it to others.

28:47.280 --> 28:49.920
Okay, I'll be more careful.

28:50.000 --> 28:51.440
Mr. Tang, you're so kind.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.040
Goodbye.

28:55.120 --> 28:56.440
Rest well.

29:04.000 --> 29:06.800
- Su Miao…
- Su Miao is resting upstairs.

29:07.680 --> 29:10.360
Yes. She fell asleep.

29:14.200 --> 29:15.200
I'll walk you out.

29:21.800 --> 29:22.960
Su Miao's feet got injured.

29:23.720 --> 29:24.720
Please take care of her.

29:25.960 --> 29:28.520
If you need anything,
feel free to call me.

29:29.160 --> 29:30.120
Okay.

29:42.760 --> 29:43.880
I'm real!

29:53.480 --> 29:55.080
Sit down.

29:58.720 --> 30:02.560
This filter is so impressive.

30:03.320 --> 30:06.200
I thought it could only make you
more beautiful.

30:06.720 --> 30:08.040
I never thought…

30:08.120 --> 30:10.240
I could only turn into Su Miao,

30:10.320 --> 30:13.200
but it gained more functions
after upgrading.

30:13.880 --> 30:14.960
Let's see.

30:15.040 --> 30:17.480
VOICE CHANGE, BEAUTY FILTER
OUTFIT, EFFECT

30:17.560 --> 30:18.600
3D PRINTING, NEW, HIDE, NEW, AUTO

30:18.680 --> 30:21.720
It's called 3D printing.

30:24.040 --> 30:25.120
3D printing.

30:25.200 --> 30:26.640
HIDE

30:28.840 --> 30:31.000
Look, it can also hide.

30:31.080 --> 30:33.960
I told you it'd be more impressive
after reviving and upgrading.

30:37.720 --> 30:39.280
HIDE

30:40.640 --> 30:43.640
Do you think it will keep on upgrading?

30:44.240 --> 30:45.280
I don't know.

30:47.160 --> 30:48.120
3D PRINTING

30:48.200 --> 30:50.920
BEAR, DOG, ALPACA, CAT, LION

30:51.000 --> 30:52.120
FIRE HYDRANT, PAINTING
BRONZE STATUE, HAMMER, BOX

30:52.920 --> 30:56.640
I can not only turn
into a statue or a painting…

30:56.720 --> 30:57.560
CACTUS, ROSE, FLOWER, TREE, HOUSEPLANT

30:57.640 --> 31:00.800
…but become plants or animals.

31:01.320 --> 31:02.680
Can you become a tiger?

31:02.760 --> 31:05.440
Yes. It can 3D-print all tangible things.

31:06.240 --> 31:08.960
- Big tiger!
- Stop doing this! Give me a break!

31:09.040 --> 31:10.480
I'm still in shock!

31:12.520 --> 31:13.520
Why are you laughing?

31:13.600 --> 31:16.480
You are so careless.

31:16.560 --> 31:18.800
Tang Qi almost caught you in the act.

31:18.880 --> 31:21.400
He looked so terrifying when he was mad.

31:21.480 --> 31:23.200
He got in while I was distracted.

31:23.280 --> 31:26.640
Lin Yuan kept screaming,
"Tang Qi is here!"

31:26.720 --> 31:28.520
I thought she wanted me to hide.

31:35.720 --> 31:37.320
Is he back again?

31:38.880 --> 31:40.560
The food delivery is at the door.

31:44.040 --> 31:45.240
It's the food.

31:49.360 --> 31:50.760
Do you mean

31:50.840 --> 31:54.320
you shot the poster as Su Miao,

31:54.400 --> 31:58.800
and Tang Qi fell in love with her

31:58.880 --> 32:01.920
and is pursuing her?

32:02.000 --> 32:03.560
That's exactly what happened.

32:07.480 --> 32:08.600
Su…

32:10.800 --> 32:13.280
What's the use of your brain?

32:13.360 --> 32:14.680
Why didn't you use it?

32:15.560 --> 32:17.920
- I did.
- I can testify. She did.

32:20.040 --> 32:21.720
Chengcheng used every means,

32:21.800 --> 32:24.760
but he was so obsessed with her face
and wouldn't let her go.

32:24.840 --> 32:25.960
There's nothing she could do.

32:27.320 --> 32:29.760
He'll find out sooner or later.

32:41.040 --> 32:42.600
It has been upgraded.

32:43.240 --> 32:46.840
I have an idea.
Maybe I can get rid of him.

32:46.920 --> 32:48.200
What idea?

32:59.240 --> 33:00.480
How is it?

33:02.280 --> 33:05.880
It's complicated,

33:05.960 --> 33:07.160
but…

33:09.520 --> 33:11.240
it's a good idea.

33:41.960 --> 33:43.840
Why don't you understand?

33:43.920 --> 33:45.640
I don't want to see you.

33:46.280 --> 33:48.160
I jumped into the lake and faked illness

33:48.240 --> 33:51.080
because I hate you
and don't want to see you.

33:51.160 --> 33:53.560
However, you didn't give up
but went to Lin Yuan's place

33:53.640 --> 33:55.320
and got me injured.

34:13.440 --> 34:14.840
Lin Yuan told me you came.

34:17.480 --> 34:19.639
Yes. Are you feeling better?

34:21.000 --> 34:22.239
It's not serious.

34:22.320 --> 34:23.960
I'll recover soon.

34:25.719 --> 34:27.719
It was my bad.

34:28.280 --> 34:30.239
I fell off by accident,

34:30.320 --> 34:31.840
yet I blamed you.

34:34.159 --> 34:37.440
I'm sorry for the trouble.

34:46.880 --> 34:50.159
CAN YOU STOP LIKING ME?

34:59.000 --> 35:00.720
Can you stop liking me?

35:32.840 --> 35:33.880
Sorry.

35:40.640 --> 35:42.800
It was supposed to be my own thing.

35:43.320 --> 35:46.040
I'm sorry for the trouble.

36:18.600 --> 36:21.080
What's wrong? He doesn't want to meet you?

36:22.920 --> 36:24.080
No.

36:50.240 --> 36:52.080
Are you free this weekend?

36:52.160 --> 36:53.240
Can we meet?

36:56.760 --> 36:57.880
Of course.

37:01.680 --> 37:03.920
I'll send you the time and place.

37:24.720 --> 37:25.720
Good night.

37:27.760 --> 37:28.840
Good night.

37:53.160 --> 37:54.120
Good night.

38:03.920 --> 38:04.920
Wait a minute.

38:10.800 --> 38:13.640
Mr. Tang, thanks.

38:13.720 --> 38:14.560
You're welcome.

38:29.080 --> 38:31.520
You haven't recovered.
You should've worked from home.

38:32.320 --> 38:33.400
Lin…

38:35.640 --> 38:37.040
My sister gave me a ride.

38:37.120 --> 38:39.560
I don't need to walk much. Don't worry.

38:47.920 --> 38:50.080
Mr. Tang, you're in a good mood.

38:52.600 --> 38:54.840
Didn't Su Miao tell you?

38:57.160 --> 38:58.360
Tell me what?

39:00.160 --> 39:01.960
We'll meet this weekend.

39:04.440 --> 39:06.480
Are you happy because of this?

39:13.440 --> 39:15.400
You must know what she likes.

39:16.600 --> 39:19.440
What do I need to do when I'm with her?

39:22.920 --> 39:24.440
Don't overthink it.

39:24.520 --> 39:26.160
Just be yourself.

39:26.240 --> 39:28.360
Leave the rest to fate.

39:31.320 --> 39:32.240
You're right.

39:34.600 --> 39:36.840
I should just be myself.

39:38.120 --> 39:41.800
Honesty is the foundation
of a relationship.

40:05.320 --> 40:07.160
This is for you.

40:07.240 --> 40:09.960
It's my favorite character, Wukong.

40:10.960 --> 40:14.760
Thank you for helping me
with the presentation.

40:16.280 --> 40:17.120
You're welcome.

40:17.840 --> 40:20.240
As colleagues, we should help each other.

40:21.080 --> 40:22.280
Bye.

40:31.160 --> 40:32.000
Su Chengcheng,

40:32.080 --> 40:33.480
you took a few days off.

40:33.560 --> 40:35.080
I'm sure you don't know much
about the plan.

40:35.680 --> 40:38.560
You should get familiar with it
and assist Xu Yue.

40:40.320 --> 40:41.280
Mr. Gu,

40:42.160 --> 40:44.600
Su Chengcheng
helped me a lot with this plan.

40:44.680 --> 40:45.920
She's also familiar with it.

40:47.880 --> 40:49.000
You mentioned

40:49.080 --> 40:51.000
you asked her to collect the data
and information.

40:51.080 --> 40:52.320
Sorry, I forgot it.

40:52.400 --> 40:53.440
That's better.

40:53.520 --> 40:55.240
You can move on to the next step.

40:55.320 --> 40:56.400
Okay.

41:12.400 --> 41:14.720
Your plan happened to be the same as mine.

41:14.800 --> 41:16.840
I didn't need to represent it twice,

41:16.920 --> 41:19.320
so I combined our plans.

41:20.760 --> 41:21.800
As you can see,

41:21.880 --> 41:23.760
I told our boss you helped me a lot.

41:24.480 --> 41:26.360
Happened to be the same?

41:26.960 --> 41:27.960
Yes.

41:29.640 --> 41:31.080
I didn't take all the credit.

41:33.280 --> 41:35.680
If you want to argue with me,

41:35.760 --> 41:38.000
they'll only think you care too much

41:38.080 --> 41:40.760
about fame and credit and lack teamwork,

41:41.280 --> 41:42.840
and no one will help you anymore.

42:00.600 --> 42:01.840
Thanks.

42:18.280 --> 42:19.320
Bye.

43:04.040 --> 43:05.840
Monster, if you do bad things again,

43:05.920 --> 43:07.320
I'll beat you up!

43:24.760 --> 43:26.520
I really saw Sun Wukong!

43:26.600 --> 43:28.640
It was a 2D Sun Wukong!

43:30.520 --> 43:34.640
It must be a cosplay.
You didn't see it clearly.

43:34.720 --> 43:36.520
No, it was absolutely not real!

43:36.600 --> 43:38.280
It was fake!

43:38.360 --> 43:39.640
I…

43:39.720 --> 43:43.960
I mean, I saw a living Sun Wukong!

43:44.040 --> 43:45.000
Well…

43:48.560 --> 43:50.800
Have some mint tea to calm down.

43:54.120 --> 43:57.360
Monster, if you do bad things again,
I'll beat you up!

44:08.360 --> 44:09.640
Sorry.

44:11.320 --> 44:14.680
You lack experience,
and the plan is immature.

44:14.760 --> 44:16.000
However,

44:16.080 --> 44:20.160
I took inspiration from your plan
and finished mine.

44:20.760 --> 44:23.320
I often say bad things about you,

44:23.400 --> 44:26.120
telling them you're always slacking off,

44:26.200 --> 44:27.720
but it's not true.

44:29.320 --> 44:31.840
I'm so sorry.

44:35.920 --> 44:37.120
I accept your apology.

44:37.720 --> 44:39.640
I saw the plan Mr. Gu gave me.

44:39.720 --> 44:42.360
Your plan is more comprehensive

44:42.440 --> 44:44.240
and feasible.

44:44.320 --> 44:46.080
You could've won with glory.

45:08.440 --> 45:09.720
Where's Su Chengcheng?

45:09.800 --> 45:10.880
She's ill.

45:10.960 --> 45:13.640
I saw her work overtime last night,
and I thought she changed.

45:13.720 --> 45:14.640
However…

45:15.160 --> 45:17.880
Do you have some
misunderstanding about her?
